tlined text-[20px]">track_changes</span><span>Skill Analysis</span></div></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 rounded-r-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low hover:text-on-surface transition-all font-body-md text-body-md" data-path="profile" href="#"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">person</span><span>Profile</span></div></a><a class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 rounded-r-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low hover:text-on-surface transition-all font-body-md text-body-md" data-path="settings" href="#"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">settings</span><span>Settings</span></div></a></nav><div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-primary-fixed/60 rounded-xl p-space-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">Career Readiness</span><span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-secondary font-bold">92%</span></div><div class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-3"><div class="h-full bg-secondary rounded-full" style="width: 92%"></div></div><a class="inline-block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary hover:text-on-secondary-container underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors" data-path="settings" href="#">Update Preferences</a></div></aside><div class="pl-60"><main class="w-full pt-16 p-space-8 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full gap-space-6 pb-space-12">
<!-- Top Context Navigation -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-2 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors font-title-sm text-title-sm" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_back</span>
<span>Back to Opportunity Stream</span>
</a>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-3">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Opportunity ID: #STR-8842-AI</span>
<div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold">Active &amp; Actively Sourcing</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Header Banner -->
<section class="w-full bg-primary-fixed/25 rounded-xl p-space-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-6">
<div class="flex items-start sm:items-center gap-space-5">
<!-- Stripe Company Emblem -->
<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-primary flex items-center justify-center shadow-md flex-shrink-0">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-primary font-bold tracking-tight">S</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-3 flex-wrap">
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">Senior AI Product Designer</h1>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">verified</span> Verified Opportunity
            </span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">
            Stripe • San Francisco, CA (Hybrid) • Posted 2 days ago
          </p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-2 mt-space-3 flex-wrap">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-semibold shadow-sm">
              Full-Time
            </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-semibold shadow-sm">
              $165,000 - $195,000 USD / year
            </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-semibold shadow-sm">
              Equity: 0.05% - 0.1%
            </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant">
              Tier 1 Sponsoring
            </span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Action Pill Group -->
<div class="flex sm:items-center gap-space-3 w-full lg:w-auto justify-end">
<button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-space-2 px-space-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-secondary font-title-sm text-title-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all" id="saveJobBtn">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">bookmark</span>
<span id="saveText">Saved to Wishlist</span>
</button>
<button class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface shadow-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">share</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 2-Column Responsive Workspace Grid (8 cols left / 4 cols right) -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-8 items-start">
<!-- Left Column: Role Details Deep Dive (8 Cols) -->
<div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-6 min-w-0">
<!-- Card 1: Role Overview & Impact -->
<article class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-2 mb-space-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">target</span>
<h2 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">Role Overview &amp; Impact</h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
          Stripe is creating sovereign programmatic economic infrastructure for artificial intelligence. As our Senior AI Product Designer, you will spearhead interface design across high-volume checkout autonomy, agentic financial permissions, and human-in-the-loop auditability.
        </p>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-space-3 leading-relaxed">
          You will translate probabilistic multi-agent models into predictable, deterministic UI paradigms that give global enterprises uncompromised visibility and security over financial operations.
        </p>
</article>
<!-- Key Focus Visual Showcase -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-3">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-primary">Autonomous Commerce Workflows</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">account_tree</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-3">
            Architecting high-consequence state machines where AI copilot actions seamlessly transfer ownership to human finance directors.
          </p>
<div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-full bg-secondary rounded-full" style="width: 85%"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-3">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-primary">LLM Latency &amp; Confidence UX</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">psychology</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-3">
            Pioneering fluid streaming feedback states, micro-confidence gauges, and generative fallback fallbacks for real-time transactions.
          </p>
<div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-full bg-secondary rounded-full" style="width: 94%"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2: What You Will Do -->
<article class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-2 mb-space-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">checklist</span>
<h2 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">What You Will Do</h2>
</div>
<ul class="flex flex-col gap-space-4">
<li class="flex items-start gap-space-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface">Partner with AI researchers and foundation engineers</span>
<span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Translate complex multi-agent inference flows into transparent, intuitive UI abstractions that preserve user control during rapid autonomous transactions.</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-space-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface">Lead end-to-end systemic design</span>
<span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Direct workflow progression from foundational customer discovery and low-fidelity specs to production-ready design system tokens built inside Stripe's design ecosystem.</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-space-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface">Establish company-wide AI interaction guidelines</span>
<span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Standardize visual representations for latency, streaming token telemetry, hallucination prevention warnings, and varying agent confidence thresholds.</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-space-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">check_circle</span>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-title-sm text-title-sm text-on-surface">Drive continuous usability cycles</span>
<span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Iterate rapidly through quantitative customer observation sessions, prototype stress-testing, and rigorous qualitative UX telemetry.</span>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</article>
<!-- Card 3: Skills & Qualifications Required -->
<article class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-6 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">neurology</span>
<h2 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wide">Skills &amp; Qualifications</h2>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary bg-secondary-container/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold">5 of 6 Skills Matched</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-space-2">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
            Design Systems (Expert)
          </span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
            Figma Components &amp; Tokens
          </span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
            Generative UI / LLM UX
          </span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
            User Research &amp; Prototyping
          </span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
            Web Standards &amp; CSS/HTML Awareness
          </span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
            Python &amp; API Integration Familiarity
          </span>
</div>
</article>
<!-- Card 4: About Stripe & Workplace -->
<article class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-2">
